 "about": "The platform's own shop on a stall, the whole resource loop without a graph doing the trade: scene_add_currency, scene_add_item (twice) and scene_add_shop; F at the stall opens the shop screen (the stall's graph calls f.openShop). The stall has four apples at five coins and one pear at eight, and buys apples for three; the character starts with twelve coins and two apples. The script clicks the apple on the shelf and 购买 (coins 12 to 7, apples 2 to 3, SH_SOLD 1), closes the 获得 notice, then 批量出售, the apple in the backpack and 出售 (coins 7 to 10, apples 3 to 2, SH_BOUGHT). Played as written on 2026-10-11. Prints: SH_READY, SH_HOLD coins apples pears (every three seconds), SH_OPEN, SH_COIN change, SH_ITEM amount, SH_SOLD n, SH_BOUGHT.",
